[ti:TorchTitan: From New Models to Training at Scale]
[ar:Ava & Brian]
[al:PyTorch Blog Podcast]
[00:00.00]Ava: Suppose you're moving a new model from pretraining into agentic RL, then scaling it across hundreds of GPUs.
[00:00.00]Ava：假设你要把一个新模型从预训练推进到智能体强化学习，再扩展到数百块 GPU。
[00:07.81]A small mismatch in model code or numerics can make debugging difficult.
[00:07.81]模型代码或数值计算稍有不一致，调试就会变得困难。
[00:13.02]That's why this TorchTitan update caught my eye.
[00:13.02]所以这次 TorchTitan 更新引起了我的注意。
[00:16.84]Brian: TorchTitan is a PyTorch-native platform for experimenting with and training generative models at scale.
[00:16.84]Brian：TorchTitan 是一个基于原生 PyTorch 的平台，用于大规模试验和训练生成式模型。
[00:24.18]This update keeps its small, extensible design while adding model support, reinforcement learning, performance work, and communication features.
[00:24.18]这次更新延续了它小巧、可扩展的设计，同时增加了模型支持、强化学习、性能优化和通信功能。
[00:34.80]Ava: The model list is striking: Qwen3.5, Qwen3-VL, Kimi K3, and DeepSeek-V4 are among the additions.
[00:34.80]Ava：新增模型名单很亮眼，包括 Qwen3.5、Qwen3-VL、Kimi K3 和 DeepSeek-V4。
[00:43.48]Are these just model definitions, or can the training stack actually scale them?
[00:43.48]这些只是模型定义，还是整个训练系统真能支持它们扩展规模？
[00:51.07]Brian: They're full training-stack integrations across TorchTitan's 5D parallelism stack.
[00:51.07]Brian：它们都完整接入了 TorchTitan 的 5D 并行训练体系。
[00:57.07]The team also introduced typed Python recipes, model-config transforms, and targeted component overrides.
[00:57.07]团队还引入了带类型标注的 Python 训练配置、模型配置转换和定向组件覆盖。
[01:04.76]Those let users change a training setup without maintaining a separate model fork.
[01:04.76]这样用户就能调整训练设置，无须单独维护一个模型分支。
[01:11.12]Ava: So if a hardware change calls for another parallelization strategy, the recipe can express it.
[01:11.12]Ava：所以硬件变化需要另一种并行策略时，可以在训练配置里表达。
[01:17.90]If a model needs a different component or kernel, an override can target that part.
[01:17.90]如果模型需要替换某个组件或内核，也可以只覆盖那一部分。
[01:23.88]The model implementation stays reusable.
[01:23.88]模型实现仍可复用。
[01:27.12]Brian: Exactly.
[01:27.12]Brian：没错。
[01:27.77]The interfaces also accept optimized Attention Gym kernels, including Gated DeltaNet, Kimi Delta Attention, and sparse-attention kernels.
[01:27.77]这些接口也支持经过优化的 Attention Gym 内核，包括 Gated DeltaNet、Kimi Delta Attention 和稀疏注意力内核。
[01:39.01]Opt-in Helion kernels include fused RoPE.
[01:39.01]可按需启用的 Helion 内核包括融合 RoPE。
[01:42.37]These choices remain compatible with torch.compile.
[01:42.37]这些选择都与 torch.compile 兼容。
[01:46.91]Ava: That raises a question: beyond the model code, what carries over to the next architecture?
[01:46.91]Ava：这就引出一个问题：除了模型代码，还有什么能沿用到下一个架构？
[01:53.00]A team bringing in a multimodal model would still need data handling, checkpoints, sharding, and a way to check the numerics.
[01:53.00]团队引入多模态模型时，仍需要处理数据、检查点、分片，以及验证数值计算。
[02:01.80]Brian: The reusable pieces include multimodal data pipelines, sample packing, shared vision components, Hugging Face checkpoint interoperability, declarative sharding, and numerical validation.
[02:01.80]Brian：可复用的部分包括多模态数据流水线、样本打包、共享视觉组件、与 Hugging Face 检查点互通、声明式分片和数值验证。
[02:14.48]The aim is to make a new architecture ready for validated, scalable training sooner.
[02:14.48]目标是让新架构更快具备经过验证的大规模训练能力。
[02:20.56]Ava: Now take that model into RL.
[02:20.56]Ava：现在把这个模型用于强化学习。
[02:22.64]Some stacks maintain separate training and inference implementations.
[02:22.64]有些系统分别维护训练和推理实现。
[02:27.77]An architecture change has to land in both places, and a reward shift becomes hard to diagnose if those implementations quietly diverge.
[02:27.77]架构变更得在两处落实；如果两套实现悄悄出现差异，奖励变化就很难排查。
[02:38.24]Brian: TitanRL addresses that by keeping the same model from pretraining through post-training and inside vLLM.
[02:38.24]Brian：TitanRL 让同一个模型贯穿预训练、后训练，并在 vLLM 中使用，以解决这个问题。
[02:45.88]You work in one codebase.
[02:45.88]整个过程只需一个代码库。
[02:47.72]That doesn't settle every RL question, but it removes one source of model drift.
[02:47.72]这不能解决强化学习的所有问题，但能消除一种模型偏移来源。
[02:53.95]Ava: Agentic workloads add another pressure point: generation can take time while training needs fresh rollouts.
[02:53.95]Ava：智能体任务还有一个压力点：生成可能耗时很久，而训练需要新的采样轨迹。
[03:01.92]TitanRL runs rollouts asynchronously, and both generation and training can scale through multiple forms of parallelism.
[03:01.92]TitanRL 异步运行采样，生成和训练也都能通过多种并行方式扩展规模。
[03:11.15]Brian: The team reports stable training for hundreds of steps on dense and MoE models.
[03:11.15]Brian：团队报告称，稠密模型和 MoE 模型都能稳定训练数百步。
[03:18.88]The tested tasks include long context, code execution, compaction, harness work, and self-play.
[03:18.88]测试任务包括长上下文、代码执行、上下文压缩、测试框架任务和自我对弈。
[03:28.18]The figure captions identify Qwen3.5-35B-A3B base runs with 64K and 128K contexts.
[03:28.18]图注标明，Qwen3.5-35B-A3B 基础模型的运行使用了 64K 和 128K 上下文。
[03:36.55]Ava: Let's make that concrete. Suppose rewards change after you enable a kernel.
[03:36.55]Ava：举个具体例子。假设启用一个内核后，奖励发生了变化。
[03:41.65]You'd want to know whether the trainer and generator assign the same log probabilities before blaming the algorithm.
[03:41.65]在归咎于算法之前，你会想确认训练器和生成器给出的对数概率是否一致。
[03:49.54]Can TitanRL check that directly?
[03:49.54]TitanRL 能直接检查吗？
[03:52.07]Brian: In supported on-policy configurations, batch-invariant mode makes their log probabilities bitwise identical.
[03:52.07]Brian：在受支持的同策略配置中，批次不变模式能让两者的对数概率逐位一致。
[03:59.87]The gap is exactly zero at every step.
[03:59.87]每一步的差值都恰好为零。
[04:02.61]That gives you a precise check on this part of the training and generation path.
[04:02.61]这为训练和生成流程的这一部分提供了精确的检查依据。
[04:08.74]Ava: That changes the diagnosis.
[04:08.74]Ava：这会改变排查方向。
[04:10.67]If the log probabilities match under that mode, you can focus on other possible causes of a reward change.
[04:10.67]如果在该模式下对数概率一致，就可以把注意力转向奖励变化的其他可能原因。
[04:18.24]The guarantee is specific to supported on-policy configurations; it doesn't promise identical rewards for every run.
[04:18.24]这项保证仅适用于受支持的同策略配置，并不保证每次运行的奖励都相同。
[04:26.87]Brian: And once a run is behaving correctly, where would you look if it's still slow?
[04:26.87]Brian：确认运行正确后，如果速度仍然慢，该从哪里查起？
[04:32.39]TorchTitan's performance work groups the problem into faster kernels, more communication and compute overlap, and finer control of memory.
[04:32.39]TorchTitan 的性能优化主要围绕更快的内核、更多通信与计算重叠，以及更精细的内存控制。
[04:42.51]Ava: One interesting choice is local_compile.
[04:42.51]Ava：一个有意思的选择是 local_compile。
[04:45.36]It applies native torch.compile selectively to important regions, without requiring full-graph or full-block tracing.
[04:45.36]它有选择地对关键区域应用原生 torch.compile，无须追踪整个计算图或整个模块。
[04:53.70]That sounds useful when a small part of a model deserves optimization, but you want to preserve its numerics.
[04:53.70]如果模型只有一小部分需要优化，而你又想保持数值计算结果，这听起来很有用。
[05:01.82]Brian: For memory, torch_remat gives fine-grained control over which activation regions get recomputed.
[05:01.82]Brian：在内存方面，torch_remat 可以精细控制哪些激活值区域需要重新计算。
[05:08.73]It's an activation checkpointing API that avoids the CPU overhead and custom operator wrappers described for earlier approaches.
[05:08.73]它是一个激活值检查点 API，避免了早期方案所述的 CPU 开销和自定义算子封装。
[05:18.30]Ava: Recomputation trades extra work for less stored activation data.
[05:18.30]Ava：重新计算会增加计算量，但能减少需要保存的激活值数据。
[05:22.81]The control matters because the best region to recompute can depend on the model and memory budget.
[05:22.81]这种控制很重要，因为最适合重新计算的区域取决于模型和内存预算。
[05:29.79]What does the update do for distributed MoE communication?
[05:29.79]这次更新如何改进分布式 MoE 通信？
[05:34.23]Brian: Dist-MoE fuses communication with expert compute on NVIDIA SM100+ GPUs.
[05:34.23]Brian：Dist-MoE 在 NVIDIA SM100+ GPU 上融合通信与专家计算。
[05:40.23]It also packs activations for dynamic tensors so execution can remain CUDA-graphable.
[05:40.23]它还为动态张量打包激活值，使执行过程仍可纳入 CUDA 图。
[05:47.41]The idea is to overlap token movement and computation rather than treating them as separate stages.
[05:47.41]核心思路是让 token 传输与计算重叠执行。
[05:56.13]Ava: Pipeline parallelism got a rewrite too.
[05:56.13]Ava：流水线并行也经过了重写。
[05:59.20]It offers deterministic, CUDA-graphable execution and controls for overlap when combined with FSDP.
[05:59.20]它提供确定性的 CUDA 图执行，并支持与 FSDP 结合时控制任务重叠。
[06:07.00]That gives users another place to tune the schedule instead of relying on one fixed execution pattern.
[06:07.00]用户因此可以进一步调整调度方式。
[06:15.39]Brian: And TorchTitan overrides can bring in specialized model kernels, such as fused MLA, fused SwiGLU, and fused Complex RoPE.
[06:15.39]Brian：TorchTitan 的覆盖机制还能引入专用模型内核，如融合版 MLA、SwiGLU 和 Complex RoPE。
[06:24.18]The configuration and override system is what lets those optimizations fit without spreading model-specific code through the trainer.
[06:24.18]配置和覆盖系统让这些优化得以接入，而不必在训练器各处加入特定模型的代码。
[06:34.20]Ava: Let's put numbers on it.
[06:34.20]Ava：来看具体数据。
[06:36.60]For DeepSeek V3 671B with its MTP1 module, the team evaluated performance on the MLPerf training benchmark on an internal GB300 cluster using MXFP8.
[06:36.60]团队使用 MXFP8，在内部 GB300 集群上，以 MLPerf 训练基准评估了带 MTP1 模块的 DeepSeek V3 671B。
[06:51.43]The report says it scaled the PP, DP, and EP axes.
[06:51.43]报告称测试扩展了 PP、DP 和 EP 三个并行维度。
[06:56.79]Brian: With PP at 2, the 256-GPU run reports 5,324.21 tokens per second per GPU and 1,362,998 globally.
[06:56.79]Brian：PP 为 2 时，256 块 GPU 的测试结果是每块 GPU 每秒 5,324.21 个 token，全局每秒 1,362,998 个。
[07:14.87]At 512 GPUs, it reports 5,262.68 per GPU and 2,694,493 globally.
[07:14.87]512 块 GPU 时，分别为每块 GPU 每秒 5,262.68 个、全局每秒 2,694,493 个。
[07:27.26]Ava: Here's the catch: the local batch size and microbatch count also change between those runs.
[07:27.26]Ava：但要注意，这两次测试的本地批大小和微批次数也不同。
[07:33.63]The higher global throughput is real for the reported configurations, but those numbers alone don't establish a fixed-workload scaling curve.
[07:33.63]所报告配置的全局吞吐量确实更高，但仅凭这些数字无法得出固定工作负载下的扩展曲线。
[07:43.84]Brian: The Muse Spark Open table shows why configuration details matter.
[07:43.84]Brian：Muse Spark Open 的数据表说明了配置细节为何重要。
[07:50.73]On the same setup, at 256 GPUs and 96K context, learned routing reports 1,500.61 tokens per second per GPU.
[07:50.73]在相同环境下，256 块 GPU、96K 上下文时，学习式路由达到每块 GPU 每秒 1,500.61 个 token。
[08:02.07]Forced balanced routing reports 1,839.52.
[08:02.07]强制均衡路由达到 1,839.52 个。
[08:06.77]Ava: And the table also has 512-GPU runs at 192K context, with more context parallelism.
[08:06.77]Ava：表中还有 512 块 GPU、192K 上下文的测试，采用了更多上下文并行。
[08:13.59]I'd keep the routing choice, context length, and parallelism visible when comparing those rows.
[08:13.59]比较这些数据时，我会明确标出路由方式、上下文长度和并行配置。
[08:21.39]A single throughput figure would hide useful engineering detail.
[08:21.39]只看单个吞吐量数字会掩盖有用的工程细节。
[08:26.99]Brian: TorchTitan is also showing up outside its own training recipes.
[08:26.99]Brian：TorchTitan 也开始用于自身训练方案之外。
[08:31.95]The update names veRL and Miles as integrations, says it's Meshy's default training backend, and says it inspires Archon, the training engine in Areal.
[08:31.95]更新提到它已与 veRL 和 Miles 集成，是 Meshy 的默认训练后端，并启发了 Areal 中的训练引擎 Archon。
[08:44.19]Ava: Another scaling issue sits below the model: how parameters and optimizer state are sharded.
[08:44.19]Ava：另一个扩展问题在模型底层：参数和优化器状态如何切分。
[08:51.19]FSDP2 supports row-wise and column-wise sharding, but distributed Muon and blockwise parameter quantization benefit from other placements.
[08:51.19]FSDP2 支持按行和按列切分，但分布式 Muon 和分块参数量化适合其他放置方式。
[09:01.80]That's where FlexShard enters.
[09:01.80]这正是 FlexShard 的用武之地。
[09:04.46]Brian: FlexShard works with buckets of parameters.
[09:04.46]Brian：FlexShard 按参数桶工作。
[09:07.70]Each bucket gets a Placement policy, and its runtime overlaps bucket communication with computation.
[09:07.70]每个桶都有一个 Placement 策略，运行时会让桶通信与计算重叠。
[09:15.23]Owned gives one rank an entire parameter.
[09:15.23]Owned 让一个 rank 持有完整参数。
[09:18.32]BlockShard uses two-dimensional tiles aligned with the sharding scheme.
[09:18.32]BlockShard 使用与切分方案对齐的二维分块。
[09:24.01]Ava: For distributed Muon, those placements avoid All Gather before the optimizer update.
[09:24.01]Ava：对于分布式 Muon，这些放置方式避免了优化器更新前的 All Gather。
[09:32.35]On DeepSeek V3 at 256 H100 GPUs, the reported optimizer time improves by up to 79% against an equivalent FSDP-only implementation.
[09:32.35]在 256 块 H100 GPU 上运行 DeepSeek V3 时，报告称优化器耗时相比等效的纯 FSDP 实现最多缩短 79%。
[09:45.60]Brian: BlockShard also aligns sharding with blockwise quantization.
[09:45.60]Brian：BlockShard 还使切分方式与分块量化对齐。
[09:51.26]It allows FP8-quantized parameter AllGathers without extra communication for scaling factors.
[09:51.26]这样就能对 FP8 量化参数执行 AllGather，且无需为缩放因子增加通信。
[10:00.03]Gathering parameters in FP8 reduces communication volume by about 50% compared with gathering them in BF16.
[10:00.03]相比汇集 BF16 参数，汇集 FP8 参数可减少约 50% 的通信量。
[10:10.12]On Llama3 405B at 256 H100 GPUs, step time improves by up to 20%.
[10:10.12]在 256 块 H100 GPU 上运行 Llama3 405B 时，单步耗时最多缩短 20%。
[10:16.60]Ava: GraphTrainer takes a different route: it builds an explicit training graph.
[10:16.60]Ava：GraphTrainer 采用另一种方式：构建显式训练图。
[10:21.81]TorchTitan says its graph-based and eager-based paths produce bitwise-matching numerical results.
[10:21.81]TorchTitan 表示，图模式与即时执行模式的数值结果逐位一致。
[10:28.55]The graph path can support cross-module fusions, graph-level debugging, and tailored hardware support.
[10:28.55]图模式可支持跨模块融合、图级调试和定制硬件支持。
[10:35.98]Brian: Communication infrastructure changed as well.
[10:35.98]Brian：通信基础设施也有变化。
[10:39.77]In PyTorch 2.14, an opt-in NCCL backend from torchcomms was ported into c10d.
[10:39.77]在 PyTorch 2.14 中，torchcomms 的一个可选 NCCL 后端被移植到 c10d。
[10:46.26]It registers under the usual nccl name and adds features including one-sided RMA windows and in-place process-group reconfiguration.
[10:46.26]它沿用常见的 nccl 名称注册，并增加了单边 RMA 窗口、进程组原地重新配置等功能。
[10:57.74]Ava: Symmetric memory connects that infrastructure to training.
[10:57.74]Ava：对称内存把这些基础设施与训练连接起来。
[11:02.58]Dist-MoE moves tokens between experts through it and fuses that movement with expert compute.
[11:02.58]Dist-MoE 通过对称内存在专家之间传输 token，并将传输与专家计算融合。
[11:10.35]TorchTitan's FSDP can also place communication buffers in a symmetric memory pool for NCCL kernels.
[11:10.35]TorchTitan 的 FSDP 还能将 NCCL 内核的通信缓冲区放入对称内存池。
[11:18.97]Brian: At that scale, checkpoint coordination matters too.
[11:18.97]Brian：在这种规模下，检查点的协调也很重要。
[11:22.58]The new torch_checkpointing library shares metadata with one collective before the first save and uses a lightweight barrier per save.
[11:22.58]新的 torch_checkpointing 库在首次保存前通过一次集合通信共享元数据，此后每次保存使用轻量级同步屏障。
[11:32.05]The older GLOO-based synchronization approach scales poorly past 16K ranks.
[11:32.05]旧的 GLOO 同步方式在超过 16K 个 rank 后扩展效果较差。
[11:37.70]Ava: In the reported 512-H100-GPU DeepSeek V3 671B run with checkpoint interval 50, average trainer blocking time falls from 841.2 ms with DCPv1 to 34.1 ms with torch_checkpointing.
[11:37.70]Ava：在报告的 512 块 H100 GPU、检查点间隔为 50 的 DeepSeek V3 671B 测试中，训练器平均阻塞时间从 DCPv1 的 841.2 毫秒降至 torch_checkpointing 的 34.1 毫秒。
[11:58.88]Average checkpoint write time falls from 384.4 s to 13.1 s.
[11:58.88]检查点平均写入时间从 384.4 秒降至 13.1 秒。
[12:06.33]Brian: Average non-resharding load time falls too, from 194.7 s to 79 s in that setup.
[12:06.33]Brian：在该配置下，无需重新分片时的平均加载时间也从 194.7 秒降至 79 秒。
[12:12.86]Those are substantial measured changes.
[12:12.86]这些都是实测的大幅改善。
[12:16.09]They also come from a named model, GPU count, and checkpoint configuration, so I'd keep that context attached.
[12:16.09]这些数据对应特定的模型、GPU 数量和检查点配置，因此需要连同这些条件一起看。
[12:25.54]Ava: The useful takeaway for me is how the pieces fit: reusable model integrations, one model path into TitanRL, checks for numerical agreement, and more control over compute, memory, and sharding.
[12:25.54]Ava：对我来说，关键是这些部分如何配合：可复用的模型集成、接入 TitanRL 的统一模型路径、数值一致性检查，以及对计算、内存和分片更灵活的控制。
[12:41.06]The qualifications matter: batch-invariant mode has supported on-policy configurations, and Dist-MoE targets SM100+ GPUs.
[12:41.06]但也要注意适用范围：批次不变模式仅支持部分同策略配置，Dist-MoE 则面向 SM100+ GPU。
[12:51.19]Brian: And the performance tables give concrete configurations to study, rather than one universal speed claim.
[12:51.19]Brian：性能表也列出了可供研究的具体配置，不能把它们概括成普遍适用的提速幅度。
[12:58.73]TorchTitan's team invites feedback as people try these features.
[12:58.73]TorchTitan 团队欢迎大家试用这些功能并提供反馈。
[13:03.37]That's our look at the update. Thanks for listening.
[13:03.37]这次更新就介绍到这里。感谢收听。
